# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — librtpi 1.0.0 CMake 包装库 liblibrtpi.a 双前缀 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-19
# Software: librtpi 1.0.0
# Gate: 真机单包实测（ohos-test-runner / build_and_test.sh，LAN 10.62.178.77）
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv
#   4. Write knowledge/doc/E0XX.md

id:                     DRAFT-librtpi-100b
trigger_tool:           conan|cmake|cmakedeps|test_package
phase:                  test_package
error_signature:        Library '.*' not found in package\. If '.*' is a system library,\ndeclare it with 'cpp_info\.system_libs' property|
                         CMake Error at .*cmakedeps_macros\.cmake:81

severity:               2
category:               cmake|conan|cmakedeps|naming|cpp_info|package_info|library
match_keywords:         Library not found in package, cmakedeps_macros.cmake, conan_package_library_targets,
                        OUTPUT_NAME, add_library, lib prefix, cpp_info.libs, liblib, double prefix,
                        CMakeDeps, find_package CONFIG

error_excerpt:          CMake Error at build/clang-15-armv8-17-release/generators/cmakedeps_macros.cmake:81 (message):
                          Library 'rtpi' not found in package.  If 'rtpi' is a system library,
                          declare it with 'cpp_info.system_libs' property
                        （库本体已构建并打包成功；产物实际为 liblibrtpi.a）

root_cause:             Unix 上 CMake 对 add_library(librtpi ...) 产物自动加 lib 前缀，
                        实际输出 liblibrtpi.a；而 conanfile 的 cpp_info.libs=["rtpi"]
                        让 CMakeDeps 在包 lib/ 目录找 librtpi.a → 找不到 → 消费者
                        find_package 阶段失败。凡"目标名以 lib 开头"的 CMake 包装
                        配方（autotools-only 上游转 CMake 包装是本仓库常见模式）
                        都会踩中：lib 前缀 + 目标名自身以 lib 开头 = 双前缀。

rec_approach:           1) set_target_properties(<target> PROPERTIES OUTPUT_NAME rtpi)
                           使产物回归上游命名 librtpi.a / librtpi.so.1，与
                           cpp_info.libs=["rtpi"] 对齐（librtpi 1.0.0 已采用）。
                        2) 或目标直接命名为 rtpi（add_library(rtpi ...)），但注意
                           目标名会被 CMakeDeps 用作导入目标基名，须与
                           cmake_target_name 声明核对，避免改名引入新错位。
                        3) 通用自查：配方 cpp_info.libs 里的每个名字 L，包 lib/
                           目录必须存在 libL.a 或 libL.so*；写完配方后用
                           ls package_folder/lib 逐一核对，可在 conan-verify G4
                           前拦住此类错位。
